<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it downgraded Intel Corp to outperform long-term from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said stock had reached Gruntal's price target of $165 a share.</p>
<p>-- said firm has &quot;no doubt that Intel's powerful money machine remains in place,&quot; but momentum is dissipating &quot;somewhat&quot; in the short term.</p>
<p>-- said remains bullish on Intel's long-term prospects since the company's industry dominance is unchallenged.</p>
<p>-- Intel lost 4-1/4 to 160-1/2.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
